    "title": "Central Missouri women's basketball expecting even bigger performance from Taylor Weishaar this season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brett Kennedy ,\n2 hours ago (WARRENSBURG, MO) - The college basketball season is about to kick off in full swing this coming weekend. Central Missouri being one of those teams, on the women's side, the Jennies are of course coached by former MoWest coach Dave Slifer. He has 3 girls from the Northwest Missouri/Northeast Kansas area are on his squad, including Riverside High School alum Taylor Weishaar. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
